{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n;  BUMP MAPPING\n;\n;  A new school effect from the demos of the mid 1990s: a picture lit\n;  by a lamp that moves over it. Its brightness is taken as height, so\n;  that every edge in it is a slope: turned towards the lamp it is lit\n;  and shines, turned away it lies in shadow. SPRITE EFFECT ADD ...,\n;  BUMP does it on the graphics card, and SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE moves\n;  the lamp. Two pictures take turns: a wall of stone, and the disk\n;  the Amiga 500 asked for when it started (Kickstart 1.3).\n;\n;  Layer 0: black   Layer 1: the pictures   Layer 2: the lamp, the text\n; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nSCREEN 640,480\nMUSIC PLAY \u0022Sound/Tracker/MODs/Paradox6.mod\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 0\nINKG \u0022Black\u0022\nBAR 0, 0, 639, 479\n\n; \u2500\u2500 Layer 1: the stone, 320 x 320 at 200 %, and the Kickstart disk \u2500\u2500\nSPRITE LOAD 1, \u0022Graphics/Textures/320_001.png\u0022\nSPRITE HANDLE 1, 160, 160\nSPRITE ZOOM 1, 200\nSPRITE POS 1, 320, 240\nSPRITE EFFECT ADD 1, BUMP, 160, 160, 10, 150\nSPRITE LOAD 2, \u0022Graphics/Layer/Amiga.png\u0022\nSPRITE POS 2, 0, 0\nSPRITE EFFECT ADD 2, BUMP, 320, 240, 12, 320\nFOR I = 1 TO 2\n  SPRITE LAYER I, 1\nNEXT I\nSPRITE ON 1\n\n; \u2500\u2500 Layer 2: the lamp, a glowing bob where the light is \u2500\u2500\nSPRITE LOAD 3, \u0022Graphics/Bobs/Firefly/05.png\u0022\nSPRITE HANDLE 3, 32, 32\nSPRITE ZOOM 3, 60\nSPRITE LAYER 3, 2\nSPRITE ON 3\n\nSCREEN SELECT 2\nFONT LOAD 0, \u0022Graphics/font.png\u0022, 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00A3$%.\u2019[]\u201D,-\u0022\nRASTER 1, 0, 440, 40, \u0022#FFE0A0, #FF8020, #FFE0A0\u0022\nRASTER COLOUR 2, \u0022Red\u0022\nTXT$ = \u0022                    BUMP MAPPING: A PICTURE WHOSE BRIGHTNESS IS ITS HEIGHT, LIT BY A LAMP THAT MOVES.\u0022\nTXT$ = TXT$ & \u0022   SPRITE EFFECT ADD 1, BUMP, LIGHTX, LIGHTY, DEPTH, RADIUS ... AND SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 0, LIGHTX, X\u0022\nTXT$ = TXT$ & \u0022 MOVES THE LAMP EVERY FRAME.   MUSIC: A PROTRACKER MODULE.   \u0022\nCW = 32\nSX = 0 : T = 0 : SCENE = 1\n\n; \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\nLoop:\n  T = T + 1\n\n  ; Every ten seconds the other picture\n  IF T MOD 500 = 0 THEN\n    SPRITE OFF SCENE\n    SCENE = 3 - SCENE\n    SPRITE ON SCENE\n  ENDIF\n\n  ; The lamp goes round on a Lissajous curve over the screen\n  LX = 320 + SIN(T * 1.3) * 250\n  LY = 220 + SIN(T * 1.9 + 40) * 160\n  SPRITE POS 3, LX, LY\n  SPRITE ZOOM 3, 55 + SIN(T * 9) * 8\n\n  ; Where that is in the picture\u0027s own pixels: the stone is drawn at 200 % round its middle\n  IF SCENE = 1 THEN\n    SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 0, LIGHTX, 160 + (LX - 320) / 2\n    SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 0, LIGHTY, 160 + (LY - 240) / 2\n  ELSE\n    SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 2, 0, LIGHTX, LX\n    SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 2, 0, LIGHTY, LY\n  ENDIF\n\n  ; The scroller\n  SX = SX + 2\n  IF SX >= LEN(TXT$) * CW THEN SX = 0\n  FONT CLEAR\n  FONT PRINT #2, 0, -(SX MOD CW), 448, MID$(TXT$ & TXT$, INT(SX / CW) + 1, 21)\n\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Loop\n","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}